  "details": "When you load into your home world when you start up the game, the world audio is not present, even when the world volume is up.\n\nRepro Steps: Start the game, load into selected home world.\n\nExpected: World audio is present, if it has any.\n\nActual: No world audio is played.\n\nI have tested this with different home worlds, and the audio either has a 50/50 chance of being there every time you load in, or it's not there at all no matter how many times you load in. Going directly to another instance of that world has the same issue.",
